Setup
-----
- `~/.dotfiles/bootstrap.sh`            : Link files, write stubs, sync agents and herdr
- `~/.dotfiles/bootstrap.sh --packages` : Also Brewfile (macOS) and `mise install`
- Replaced files are kept as `<file>.bak.<timestamp>`

Scripts (not on PATH, run as $DOTFILES/bin/<name>)
--------------------------------------------------
- `agents-sync`       : Write ~/.codex/AGENTS.md; create ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md import stub
- `herdr-config-sync` : Write ~/.config/herdr/config.toml and reload the herdr server
- `claude-statusline` : Claude Code status line (model, context %)
- `sync-forks`        : Rebase my forks on upstream

Cheatsheets
-----------
- `cheat <name>` / `cheat -l` : Show a sheet / list sheets (`cheat/` in this repo)
- `cheat -e <name>`  : Edit or create a sheet

Where local config goes
-----------------------
- `~/.zshrc.local`, `~/.zshrc`, `~/.zshenv` : Machine zsh config (stubs source the repo)
- `~/.gitconfig`      : user.email and machine git settings
- `~/.vimrc.local`    : Machine vim/nvim config
- `~/.config/herdr/config.local.toml` : Then run herdr-config-sync
- `~/.agents-local/*.md` : Then run agents-sync

Aliases
-------
- `cd-dotfiles`, `zshconfig`, `zshsource`, `gitconfig`
